# Effective cooldown modifiers (ArcheAge Classic, patch 293). Tab-separated, one row per source.
# Columns:
#   id            buff/debuff id (0 = detect by name only)
#   name          buff name exactly as the client reports it
#   scope         skillset tree the modifier applies to (empty or "all" = every tree)
#   skill         skill-name filter (empty = all skills of the scope)
#   pct           flat percentage removed from the cooldown (applied once)
#   flat          flat seconds removed from the cooldown (applied once)
#   pctPerStack   percentage per stack
#   flatPerStack  seconds per stack
#   maxStacks     stack clamp for the per-stack columns
#   effect        dynamic | reset | passive | snap
#   icdMs         internal cooldown for reset effects, milliseconds
#
# dynamic = applied only while the aura is visible on the target (reverts when it fades)
# reset   = proc that makes the tree's cooldowns ready (handled separately from the ratio)
# passive = known skillset passive; only a snapping candidate, never applied by default
# snap    = extra candidate ratio for learning (pct is the total reduction it stands for)
